# PRIVACY GUARD: real health data must never be committed to this repo.
# The app keeps all data on the device. These patterns catch the files
# it produces (backups) and typical wearable exports, in case one ends
# up in the working tree by accident.
health-backup-*.json
*.backup.json
exports/
private/
data/
*.csv
!sample-data/*.csv
*.zip
*.xlsx

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
